Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.61,0:03:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,卖完了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.33,0:03:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…去其他地方看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.87,0:03:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,咦 这里也是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.23,0:03:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.77,0:03:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,虽说会有点贵…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.07,0:03:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,怎…怎么会…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.73,0:03:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我一整天的乐趣欸…
